<title>USA: Lennar names Stuart Miller president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Lennar names Stuart Miller president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lennar Corp said Wednesday it had named Stuart Miller as president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Miller is the son of Lennar's co-founder and chairman, Leonard Miller.</p>
<p>Stuart Miller currently is the president of Lennar's principal homebuilding subsidiary and its principal asset management subsidiary.</p>
</text>
